  "title": "Penne, Tomato, and Mozzarella Salad",
  "description": "A quick, easy pasta salad recipe with the bright, fresh flavors of tomato and basil. Toss hot pasta with garlic, scallions, cheese, olives, and more.",
  "authors": [
